Project lineage
---------------

* The original application was created with Shakespeare as "Mew" and was
  subsequently developed and renamed "Ditto" by Alex Gleason and other Ditto
  contributors. That history is preserved in this repository.

* Portions of the encrypted community, chat, wallet settings, and wire-sync
  implementation were adapted from Soapbox Armada:
  https://gitlab.com/soapbox-pub/armada
  Armada is licensed under AGPL-3.0.

* 2140.wtf contributors have substantially extended those foundations with
  original funding, agent, wallet, Cashu, Nostr, privacy, community, market,
  pet, native-app, and user-interface work. These modifications are identified
  in the Git history and are released under AGPL-3.0-only.

